<view wx:if="{{singlePage}}" class="timeline-notice">正在预览分享内容。保存、编辑或查看更多，请点击微信底部的“前往小程序”。</view>
<view class="page food-page">
  <view class="food-heading"><text class="eyebrow">万绿智游 · 客家味道</text><view class="title">这一餐，吃点河源味</view><view class="subtitle">认识几道地方菜，再找一家顺路的店。</view><view class="food-heading-line"><text>家常菜</text><view></view><text>湖鲜</text><view></view><text>地方小食</text></view></view>
  <view class="food-filters"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="food-filter {{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item}}</button></view>
  <view class="dish-card card" wx:for="{{dishes}}" wx:key="id"><view class="dish-heading"><view class="dish-stamp">{{item.mark}}</view><view class="grow"><text class="dish-type">{{item.type}}</text><view class="place-name dish-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="dish-flavor">{{item.flavor}}</view></view></view><view class="dish-intro">{{item.intro}}</view><view class="dish-tip"><text class="tip-label">点单前</text><text>{{item.note}}</text></view><button class="dish-search" data-query="{{item.query}}" bindtap="copy"><view><text>复制地图搜索词</text><view class="search-query">{{item.query}}</view></view><text class="search-arrow">↗</text></button></view>
  <view class="food-footnote"><view class="footnote-title">找店时，先看这三项</view><view class="footnote-item"><text>01</text><view>到店时间是否营业，地址是否顺路。</view></view><view class="footnote-item"><text>02</text><view>实际菜单、份量与收费方式。</view></view><view class="footnote-item"><text>03</text><view>同行者的过敏原与饮食忌口。</view></view></view>
  <view class="source-section"><button class="source-toggle" bindtap="toggleSources"><text>菜品资料来源</text><text>{{sourcesOpen ? '收起 −' : '查看 ＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{sourcesOpen}}" class="source-list"><button wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="url" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="copySource"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>复制链接 ↗</text></button><text class="source-date">资料核对：2026-10-24</text></view></view>
  <view class="end-note">本页提供菜品介绍与搜索词，<view>不提供店铺预订或价格承诺。</view></view>
</view>
